    "pool-revoke-op-id",
    "liquidity-pool-removed"
  ],
  "why": "Revoking a trustline's authorization makes stellar-core withdraw the holder's shares of every pool with that asset, remove the pool-share trustline and put each asset into a new claimable balance whose ID hashes ENVELOPE_TYPE_POOL_REVOKE_OP_ID. Readers that see only a flag change miss the removed trustline, the removed pool and both balances.",
